      "writtenOn": "2022-01-27T11:53:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "According your comment, you are based on AptxMode to choose the min/max value. I don\u0027t see there is TWS in the AptxMode, but how can you know to use TWs min/max value?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 25,
