      "writtenOn": "2022-01-27T13:52:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s not kind of related with mode directly.\nIf TWS kind of device is there then it will provide those values as well along with LL and HQ mode.\n\nTo simplify, with type of devices for\nLegacy devices -\u003e {minLL, maxLL, minHQ, maxHQ, forbidden values for TWS} \nTWS devices -\u003e {minLL, maxLL, minHQ, maxHQ, minTWS, maxTWS (proper values updates for TWS also)}\n\nWe provide all values initially irrespective of mode. And at run time mode change encoder accordingly adapt to these values without restarting itself as we update all these values beforehand itself to encoder to finetune itself based on type of scenarios.",
      "parentUuid": "3259d96c_0bdc447d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 25,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 26,
        "endChar": 17
      },
      "revId": "ca23b75dda5525ae83a89a06e3312f757b63487d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
