      "writtenOn": "2022-01-27T18:17:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My question is how can the encoder or sink determine if it is TWS or not? It is clear to know if it is HQ, LL, or ULL by AptxMode, but should it check AptxAdaptiveChannelMode for TWS?\n\nBtw, I think here the TWS means TWS+ which phone side handles L/R two channel links?",
